- Relevant enrolment information.
- A clear enrolment CTA.
- Share programme action.
- Syllabus download where available.

When visitors select a particular child programme, its detail page must open directly.

The parent/container page should also make it easy to navigate back to its available children.

Do not expose administrative-only information, unpublished content or internal tutor data.

