- Partially paid.
- Active with an upcoming renewal.
- Renewal due.
- Outstanding balance.

This must apply to both:

- Individually enrolled students.
- School-enrolled students with at least one independently funded programme.

It must not unlock self-service billing for parent-enrolled children.

